    "end_char": 63
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b002",
    "tag": "p",
    "source_path": "article/4",
    "text": "一、导航系统PK：谁才是“真·空间透视眼”？",
    "start_char": 64,
    "end_char": 86
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b003",
    "tag": "p",
    "source_path": "article/5",
